{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "noinput",
 "version": "0.6",
 "title": "(no)input machine",
 "description": "NO INPUT, an SRC machine that emulates no-input mixing: each track is a feedback loop (delay, tone, clipper, noise) that can listen to another track, to all the other tracks or to the audio inputs, so tracks patched into each other howl like a desk fed back into itself. Digitakt mk1; needs core 3.0 and machine-pages 1.2.",
 "category": "Examples",
 "author": "",
 "license": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
